{% set title = 'Blue Marloc Tokens: Available Tokens' %}
<h2>{{ title }}</h2>

<h3>Token namespace</h3>
<p>
  All custom tokens use the <code>bluemarloc</code> namespace.
</p>

<h3>Static date token</h3>
<dl>
  <dt><code>[bluemarloc:year-next-month]</code></dt>
  <dd>Prints the first day of next month formatted as <code>YYYY-MM</code>.</dd>
</dl>

<h3>Taxonomy term render token</h3>
<dl>
  <dt><code>[bluemarloc:term:{tid}:{view_mode}]</code></dt>
  <dd>
    Renders the taxonomy term identified by <code>{tid}</code> using the
    <code>{view_mode}</code> view mode for <em>taxonomy_term</em>.
  </dd>
  <dd>
    Example: <code>[bluemarloc:term:261:taxonomy_term_micro]</code>
  </dd>
</dl>

<h3>Basic node delegation</h3>
<dl>
  <dt><code>[bluemarloc:basic-node:*]</code></dt>
  <dd>
    Delegates to Node tokens for the node with ID <code>1</code>.
    Examples:
    <ul>
      <li><code>[bluemarloc:basic-node:title]</code></li>
      <li><code>[bluemarloc:basic-node:url]</code></li>
    </ul>
  </dd>
</dl>
